Check the selected card's scope and textual preconditions against the
actual code: types, layout/contiguity and parallel ownership, storage placement,
pipeline stages/ordering, and required hardware features. Follow the optimization
instructions in body; intent is a brief summary. Preserve unrelated mechanisms and the complete
problem. Do not assume a baseline implementation that was not supplied.

